# Strumline: the key's chords, their shapes, strumming by hand and by pattern, the bass, the progression
# (play, presets, step entry, live recording, undo, clear) and saving. b0..b10 the chord keys, w0..w15 strings.
wait 200
expect view 0
expect code 0
shot boot.png
# C major: I is C, x32010
expect fret0_0 255
expect fret0_1 3
expect fret0_2 2
expect fret0_3 0
expect fret0_4 1
expect fret0_5 0
# the white keys strum the chord by hand, string by string
tapkey w1
tapkey w2
tapkey w3
expect string3 >10
# ARP off: Freeplay. A chord key selects, silently; the bass (Follow) plays its root while it is held
tap ARP
expect par0 0
key b4 down
wait 30
expect code 4
expect bass 31
key b4 up
wait 30
expect bass 0
tap ARP
expect par0 5
# a chord held: the pattern (Folk) runs, with the bass under it
key b5 down
wait 40
expect running 1
expect code 5
expect bass 33
wait 1200
shot pattern.png
key b5 up
wait 40
expect running 0
# ENV held: the 7th (vi7 is code 5 + 11)
press ENV
key b5 down
wait 40
expect code 16
key b5 up
release ENV
wait 40
# the key: PRESETS one turn, C minor; its III is Eb
turn PRESET 1
expect par18 1
key b2 down
wait 30
expect code 2
key b2 up
turn PRESET -1
expect par18 0
# ---- the progression: the default is I V vi IV over 4 bars (96 BPM: a bar is 2.5 s)
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
expect code 0
wait 2600
expect code 4
wait 2500
expect code 5
shot playing.png
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
wait 300
# a preset (Song page, KNOB 2): Jazz ii-V-I is the fifth
tap SEQ
expect view 3
spin K2 4
expect prog0 13
expect prog2 8
expect prog4 12
shot song.png
# undo, and redo
tap LFO
expect prog0 1
tap LFO
expect prog0 13
# ---- step entry, half bars (Song KNOB 3): vi, IV, rest (the chord goes on), V
spin K3 1
expect par13 1
tap REC
expect stepmode 1
expect cursor 0
tapkey b5
tapkey b3
expect prog0 6
expect prog1 4
expect cursor 2
tap LFO
expect prog2 0
expect cursor 3
tapkey b4
expect prog3 5
shot step.png
tap REC
expect stepmode 0
# ---- live recording: count-in off (Setup KNOB 2), REC (step entry) then PLAY records
tap GLO
spin K2 -1
expect par15 0
tap REC
tap PLAY
expect recording 1
wait 1200
key b1 down
wait 100
key b1 up
tap PLAY
expect recording 0
expect prog1 2
# LFO held: the progression cleared; LFO: undo
press LFO
wait 1600
release LFO
expect prog0 0
tap LFO
expect prog0 6
# the shapes follow the tuning: Drop D (Setup KNOB 1), D (V7 of G... here II7 of C is D7): its low string
spin K1 1
expect par16 1
# ---- it saves by itself when quiet, and comes back after a restart
wait 6000
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 100
expect prog0 6
expect par16 1
expect par13 1
shot after_reboot.png
